      "summary": {
        "en": "Only the long head crosses the shoulder; all heads extend the elbow.",
        "zh": "只有长头跨肩关节；各头都能伸肘。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "All three heads of triceps are drawn as one mesh here. Only the long head starts on the shoulder blade and crosses the shoulder, where it helps pull the arm back; all three straighten the elbow [M48].",
        "zh": "这里把肱三头肌三个头画成一个网格。只有长头起于肩胛骨、跨过肩关节，在那里帮着把手臂往后拉；三个头都能伸肘 [M48]。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clavicle",
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "clavicle.l",
      "bilateral": {
