      },
      "name": {
        "en": "Scapula",
        "zh": "肩胛骨"
      },
      "short": {
        "en": "Scapula",
        "zh": "肩胛骨"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The shoulder blade carries the arm socket and cuff origins.",
        "zh": "肩胛骨承载关节盂，也是肩袖的起始骨。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The spine separates the supraspinous and infraspinous fossae; the subscapular fossa faces the ribs. The acromion and spine start the middle and back deltoid, and the lateral border starts the teres muscles [M48].",
        "zh": "肩胛冈分开冈上窝和冈下窝，肩胛下窝朝向肋骨。肩峰和肩胛冈是三角肌中、后部的起点；外侧缘是圆肌的起点 [M48]。"
      },
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "connects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "humerus",
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "humerus.l",
      "bilateral": {
        "axis": "x",
