      },
      "name": {
        "en": "Humerus",
        "zh": "肱骨"
      },
      "short": {
        "en": "Humerus",
        "zh": "肱骨"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "The upper-arm bone receives the shoulder muscles’ pull.",
        "zh": "肱骨承接肩部肌肉的拉力。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The head sits in the glenoid. The three posterior cuff tendons meet the greater tubercle; subscapularis meets the lesser. Deltoid ends at its lateral tuberosity, while teres major ends on the medial lip of the intertubercular groove [M48] [M86].",
        "zh": "肱骨头位于关节盂。肩袖后方三条肌腱止于大结节，肩胛下肌止于小结节。三角肌止于外侧的三角肌粗隆，大圆肌止于结节间沟内侧唇 [M48] [M86]。"
      },
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "connects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "forearm",
      "group": "skeleton",
      "mesh": "forearm.l",
      "bilateral": {
