      "name": {
        "en": "Radius and ulna",
        "zh": "桡骨与尺骨"
      },
      "short": {
        "en": "Radius & ulna",
        "zh": "桡骨与尺骨"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Completes the elbow for presses and rows.",
        "zh": "补全推举和划船时用到的肘部。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The radius and ulna, drawn as one mesh on each side. Biceps ends on the radius and triceps on the ulna; bending the elbow changes where the hand sits in rotations and rows. The forearm does not twist in this model [M2] [M48].",
        "zh": "每侧把桡骨和尺骨合成一个网格。肱二头肌止于桡骨，肱三头肌止于尺骨；屈肘会改变旋转和划船时手的位置。模型里前臂不能单独旋转 [M2] [M48]。"
      },
      "material": {
        "color": "tissue",
        "tint": "token:bone"
      },
      "connects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "thorax",
