      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "The sternum, ribs and costal cartilages, drawn as one mesh. Serratus anterior wraps round the ribs to the rib-facing side of the shoulder blade [M1] [M2].",
        "zh": "胸骨、肋骨和肋软骨合成一个网格。前锯肌从肋骨绕到肩胛骨贴着肋骨的那一面 [M1] [M2]。"
      },
